{"about_the_game":"Admine is a new take on a classic minesweeper puzzle game with procedurally generated levels that challenge the player to get to the exit through a mine infested facility. Featuring simple achievements focused on rewarding various player skills instead of pure grind and countless possible layouts of the levels, Admine provides a replayable experience in bite-sized chunks.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Classic Minesweeper puzzle with a newer spin<br></li><li> Procedural Level Generation<br></li><li> Music by 3kliksphilip<br></li><li> Clean, minimalistic design<br></li><li> Quick and easy to start gameplay for short sessions, with an option for a 'story' playthrough<br></li><li> 5 Difficulty levels ranging from small and simple office levels to sprawling server farms littered with traps<br></li><li> A Nightmare difficulty for people that want a challenge<br></li><li> Scores for speedrunners and completionists to try and improve</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"0897e4491e08400b4467aced9c4335a41c40741a.jpg","localized_name":"Logged In","name":"Logged In","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/785870/0897e4491e08400b4467aced9c4335a41c40741a.jpg"},{"icon":"ffee7a55e1a58ab1c782658d893ac372943f61cd.jpg","localized_name":"Opened Office","name":"Opened Office","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/785870/ffee7a55e1a58ab1c782658d893ac372943f61cd.jpg"},{"icon":"55300f26e3f87609d91a00a8e221c1804ce69f8a.jpg","localized_name":"Industry Standardalized","name":"Industry Standardalized","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/785870/55300f26e3f87609d91a00a8e221c1804ce69f8a.jpg"},{"icon":"3a9fe2249638e5f9a0e378ffdf685ce612609dc9.jpg","localized_name":"Server Farming","name":"Server Farming","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/785870/3a9fe2249638e5f9a0e378ffdf685ce6126